{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50174","headline":"□□（伯三八八五[一]三六一九） 二 · 李邕","name":"□□（伯三八八五[一]三六一九） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"□□（明时）[一]奉遣出（别）皇（黄）州，行至汉阳南渡头。\n春风不解传乡信，江月偏能照客愁。\n（[一]此第二首，又见伯二五五五卷，校其缺字异文三事。\n又「渡头」作「度」，「乡信」作「香」，不及原卷〖伯三八八五〗之善。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李邕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}